  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ecological management to benefit ecosystem services and sustainable production in smallholder oil palm systems in Malaysia and Indonesia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Research and development activity contributing to the UK&#x2019;s strategy to address key development challenges.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Research translation grant to deliver workshops for oil palm plantation smallholders in South Asia to promote uptake of management options. Biodiversity, ecosystem functioning, and yield across smallholdings using different management options will be assessed in order to improve on future guidance. SDG 2, 8, 12</narrative>
  </description>
